  "story": {
    "day": 65,
    "title": "Kaya's Christmas Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya got up early for Christmas vacation.",
      "She went to her grandmother's home. Her grandmother live there.",
      "Everyone was busy at noon. Kaya helped cook much food.",
      "She made the white tablecloth nice. Kaya used a stapler for decorations.",
      "It was a useful tool. Kaya's aunt brought Mexican tacos.",
      "\"Are these yours?\" Kaya asked.",
      "\"No, theirs,\" Grandma said. The big bowl was ours.",
      "The small one was hers. Kaya really enjoyed helping.",
      "She did not miss her school soccer or tennis club activities.",
      "Also, she had no school interview today.",
      "Later, they would go to a nearby temple. They would listen to bells at night.",
      "The party came to an end. Kaya felt active all day."
    ]
  }
